  "description": "Provides real-time email mailbox checking, including domain-specific logic and SMTP commands, to verify email addresses and remove up to 95% of bad emails, ensuring the inbox is live and reducing bounce rates. Includes features like typo correction, mobile domain detection, Whois details, and a Deliverability Confidence Score.",
